    "Does Velatek give an acceptable leak limit, or require an immediate stop on diaphragm leakage? The evidence does not answer this. Priority P2 and no immediate stop are planner judgements, so confirm with the supervisor given that chemical is being released. If the leak creates an exposure or environmental hazard, stop and isolate.",
    "Is a standby dosing pump available to maintain dosing while P-201 is isolated?",
